  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9f7710f410b7cda6b42575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手真强，唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35ca7be02968dd0c7969db7b9446e0dae7ee4963b475eda6540a820c65b49f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a9ab7a200f72b5d5cdcc43b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，要反省了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "929668e380ca439fa9f9f155209f12956f09bf88e33e18dd3f640d7115c5e2d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44480fdf0034074395522c03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你看见我难堪的样子了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d526e5327d05cd35f33f134cb31659cbbf827416b95c32c6879726b6508a8c4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58dd239da9abbbde5273262a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吗！\r\n这就是我的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20f49bc7a0c2968d3564d206e336b7c431e8c272a87089e57b4f91bcc955122a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dfa9ca8268a3f3d923bdd10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好！领先的位置就由我收下了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba172245674a3fb1a8b8d9de54799fb9249c679d5a26ed647c624ef512199e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a2f8805b5ee4035e3638baf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热血的对决，我都快要融化了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7bf983fde7cf015d112d65ca3e3743ddc6b6151f4c36b0a311c65d9ea63118",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fb3c72a7a151c7117538ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好！领先的位置就由我收下了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba172245674a3fb1a8b8d9de54799fb9249c679d5a26ed647c624ef512199e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174bc3fe367666555b28e0c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53f21bb6178812eb68837e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽全力……向前迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e226fbbf053c576eaa54bbd1d4262b2b227ea5e3d4efb26a699b46024909cf79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4282287635051b0fab1886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到打工问我就对了！\r\n赖恩，回宿舍后\r\n我会严格指导你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61dd92a15b0cdf2013d2f69b261653cc16790a63bcedd031db7e79069081d25d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5312feacffea88a7d7977b1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想在发型上变花样就交给我吧。\r\n我常帮妹妹们弄头发，所以很习惯。\r\n……因为想把她们打扮得很可爱嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70721542011e88f24ae694ba2bf4e0b561c173044b1bf3eddbe987cbbe7dab30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1fea9803424ab95300c579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～！我要不断、不断不断地前进！\r\n……呼啊。我还能继续跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cdb9a22b66e95091af694d6dded6a1be2b0e348a0dfbc752139cf6a84a0805a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a4663c8cfa040099439f0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赖恩总是能在最后的最后展现决心。\r\n她真的……非常厉害呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "320278583b8a5ec2c28d680d7aa6bed33f7d9b28e8cde4b352d60586e45fc5ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aecb66c5676cfe4a865ec33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "附上我珍藏的赠品给你♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3e8c870071d855c117fb9c137a1d147f204e9ef0223ae7c3094506a03ff208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c0cf60ea6166dce65c7ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临──！店里每个品项都\r\n灌注了满满的感谢跟心意！\r\n请尽情享用吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "99a35ad6a2812420ff8ec33c64a3e3e258f846bb168ac513d9368faf7313a01b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc53787e22b6d2253b1a5c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰♪大家久等了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75ca14b6d1e5620cdea01ead21014befa8a0541edd8897aaf3ef4b15976bff84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1e3cd8b8b75e500c251c934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可能，有～点紧张呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df4869cce74b3868b7907713f539b2405e3b35a1fbbffd9849f21db4a7f6b823",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac03a8ce0f3a964e905d8f31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要小心不要努力过头了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa43c302da05cda6fdf13ebe4aa7ca40ad802e3e03155f82e43c68c62b0b4ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:341816722b1cb1f35fa6b201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向你搭话时确实是有点出于担心。\r\n不过，你很努力又让人放心不下，\r\n于是我开始想和你一起奔跑了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f51cbe9629bce4fb0b7bbc5d6deaa13342b25f044bc62341a684b8d29533a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:955ccc1f21e44583207777a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我妹妹们也很向往这套制服呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3084395d050a1c8c01c34c6b52ca1b8969eb3c8f25b486713a791c0cfad2ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6e3d9beb39a00d843f9870e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短裤穿起来意外地方便活动呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cf6c44cd7f91753cd5b6ed076abe44d04cc4e1d145e784c45396db86ae677a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eca38ff5778bb7b0bbe7f6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是这套衣服最能鼓起干劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b5f0ff7e77723cd551020aeb62fdee19d9d25368871cddbab8adc5c624e263",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa7d41815244698d7d888aec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在打工的地方穿过各种制服，\r\n但还是最喜欢这件！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5e02c50628ff8ea9059de61780fdf47635ba3dc2244e63cd98ed14cc7ec4c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72cc10dbcea8804bd870b44a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有一天应该能配得上这套衣服吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb257d207c6a8ba2c25945f877ec7ab81b322cca81ee2ad1449264d761928e40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68bd5d8a23971ba8b7d1afb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要刮起一阵超华丽的旋风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f23b397020681c64c292a327dd8f3c4646fc2d63809176bf88b9b44a97cbe88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490bb8a29d0d565bd7e863db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上可爱制服就会更有动力工作呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64cad841c43b8785bfcb018303082dba0fa2c5a16dda1c9fc02694f003d2e420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32423fc0a6251e16032eef9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个布贴是妹妹们做给我的喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3cd34d2ad46eff6b0d940b6d973cef4e68235370dd8f0736f6034e178f8ba53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:592a8e98b46f6d0f9ba216e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好，顺利换好衣服了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c504d885a5962f0bfb8809cfd4940aa87eabbc945b2720132e64f81dc541456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:528760d56070e9a33ab658df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，别闹了，这样很痒～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09742becc52ffd1cae8f92df7ec042e372b252f20661d3a92b6f6c2cebe78c0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
