      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7705fe5a323494d9f8d4b0c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミが挑戦者？よろよろ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77b4ce97c332a0dddd14ae316db0e454d8952b007121e503afc0645426a89d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20082d6be2fbe3228d33476c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へー、やるね！\r\nでも…今度は追いつける？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d99a2860e5a6748ec8d65ed84b683a8e3e7a9d2133c2103212e5a2ef609c9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2ac0fd5a7c6feeac4b3948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安早安～♪\r\n你有好好吃早餐吗？\r\n储满能量努力一整天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "020d859abd7aff113c1c46c5689a6d96cd207aab4410a69c5e109b5aeb71bf7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed14e8a314ea4642704716ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发没有乱翘吧？\r\n衬衫有烫好吗？\r\n……好！那就出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2afc2f290c06f863d7c21617d4a6b7eb43d8f8bdcdc9831e3e94ed98af27638a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80cee9e21dafc7206c25c1cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大吃一顿后就变得很有精神！\r\n所以我要去做冲刺训练，\r\n帮助消化了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "110d333888f5376fab29fb16bd57e6af018f599f06523073a664ba2f16a9779d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b10fa53c2f75717aef71bfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔会去一间餐厅帮忙，\r\n下次去那里吃午餐吧！\r\n我可以帮你把饭升级成大碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f49bd1a58ed0eb324f2e4f6a6088c77ad61152a68d6588f09a377bbd03bdd2dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4cd66565e02e55415b7e28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，害我捏了一把冷汗～！\r\n今天的打工外送去到偏远深山里……\r\n我一直担心会赶不上门禁时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42becf0b91d5e5ffefbd0f7d47d781f63b9892ec72d514c6ef73ceef23f0a376",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b58bad897da25d491d440c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对妹妹们说如果熬夜，鬼就会\r\n跑出来……但她们一点都不怕！\r\n还反过来吓我～",
      "source_fingerprint": "708473ac84018a47ed41e3b235c10d40010d9e47a143a892b5d9c820416633c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5410aaaea4281777d0f41499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了春天，会有许多新生\r\n开始想家吧……对了，\r\n去邀她们一起跑步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e639c4c6e9b3ec41065cf9923a431efcd305b3166d8b35d9c98288ed22b6f077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0612b58d764f320cdae643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海之家、旅馆、打扫游泳池……\r\n夏天有许多难得的打工机会！\r\n嗯～今年该做什么好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13970ee051193b9b184bfc5cdba11888ee9cd50c8e27f34a7d500da8dc505c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7493a1f546ae3b81c7cd978a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次看见被扫成一堆的落叶，\r\n就会想起曾和妹妹们一起烤番薯……\r\n好！下次回去时再烤一次吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5ec224054d61b425245baaf0ae656c3408a6565fa2ee8b5815b1ef92ec60e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6af9f347b705f97cb77ea9e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天有圣诞礼物和压岁钱……\r\n真是令人开心！虽然开心……\r\n但是不是该多接一些打工呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9adcc56878af95d1afcb01bf83b1221422811ec6092c25040bc5fab840c1f4f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f147ddeb1164cb99f78b600",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰～！\r\n要不要喝杯咖啡提神啊？\r\n姐姐我去拿来给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89546ed76a85ef2e427411e41ec5ff75256f8cda38f9b838db64d5dfcef256c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807336e870bbb03c050e38fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～一大早打完工后晒晒太阳\r\n真是格外舒畅！啊，你现在\r\n正要去上工吧？加油啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c41138bcfe128563f4bdddcac04836bd78a87ceb5e8d36b1ca493caf152964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ba118a9098ea87c8df383e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你吃午餐了吗？\r\n我手上有些打工处的折价券，\r\n还没吃的话一起去吃吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac867f5edf445a6c7c57305d3290103282aa36614bc92a60f72b0a926e71e8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58001ba512f6485676a666cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人找我点一份午间套餐……\r\n我也知道是自己不该穿成这样\r\n走进咖啡厅啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22d87f6c805d6c6eb5ff3d8509c11d475813b7c743f113ec0784e16d0e5a9f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5673c8440a0608c7323efba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作到这么晚真是辛苦了。\r\n我在你桌上放了一份三明治，\r\n饿了就当夜宵吃吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe7ff60061f1600ba5e1c5d1e48f793c17299962e7059d9f4fe0bf490a1c0ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94ec07ded9a37f3babeca1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也很推荐下班后到咖啡厅放松喔。\r\n顺便一提，即使时间很晚，\r\n我也愿意随时为你服务喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ecb20f58a63d5efbb3b5f23b9b9d17344a55e66f8c57c208ed0d091d26c3ae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9ab6db3f058cdcdecb5c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到新生就会忍不住\r\n想多多照顾她们呢。\r\n送些点心应该没关系吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b3a1363c5e86ceefa2ea4bb5cde3eef69074e1e989ecb76e68d5c92e35bc12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b925635d720fb61224acfc23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天阳光很强，要多注意喔！\r\n对了，要不要戴上遮阳帽？\r\n我现在用不上，可以借你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f022a09b12b53d951877e9b5aa58e25aebe183ee7e6842ee0f8c5dd420aaf8b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf3a20bf260740f940e71f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋季限定料理的季节到了！有成堆的\r\n南瓜和栗子要处理，感觉会很忙……\r\n不对，我忘了我正在休假！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20b7dbc1977bfe7608cdc6f6239d5943731ebef55000b527140d192eb8ab84b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc168ed9851e6316ffd23c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气这么冷就想来点暖和的食物呢～\r\n顺便告诉你端热食的诀窍，\r\n手要放在容器底部的突出处♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcce5f068319856e4eda9d8722201b42ee6523ff0616cab51158fd5b014d9b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbfddbe2d0431d25bb337d25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89d464e8115ea91cc1f8cdfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8af69e9f91b20e89ca46271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～果然和小赖恩一起训练最棒了！\r\n有种互相竞争的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "308cfb902c3969a827ddd77b0453ee890b02740250218b1a024d76fc4022e047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cab40e3b0b476bb99e72e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～虽然想和妹妹们一起玩……\r\n但她们也会担心打扰到我训练，\r\n真让人烦恼～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35a9188fa4f05f7f2d0fff7717eb9235c8a8648472a5ad28209828b4bbe67b6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d660d43948a7af20f0c221d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小太阳神一起玩时，\r\n最重要的就是气势！\r\n总之先嗨起来！……应该是这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35943aa4ee83c360dd447208a3783b3789f30dcfd02b2131f5d8648faf892a15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4d252516430375d3e34ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你说，明天先不要买午餐！\r\n我有想尝试的食谱，\r\n希望你能陪我一起试味道♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b618763f4ee2a92e8588910f81fe36c1c82288016b314d73ad2eba91f79e57c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fcf32cf99a9eb8669c24242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的雀斑很可爱吧？\r\n呵呵，妈妈也说\r\n这是有精神的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba6c46ab58e4e5d9e53088c710e63df3b5782b336a1a258a117bf129e561d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7797696b7d96f4a1593519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……总觉得不太自在……\r\n这件衣服果然还是有点太可爱了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e396c31a7552840dfda16ae92fd09210e94de9b93c0dcefb50ec67d1c0905375",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f07c4284c46e4f531c1abb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能多参加几场演唱会，\r\n我要参加很多比赛拿下胜利！\r\n好～我燃起斗志了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "539398a2e95705f1aadfe673574cf7af9c623c9d52bcfdff9c7a3c9a09fff509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d9ef3b9447ed956526c42a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家人的意志、你的意志，\r\n还有我自己的意志……这件衣服\r\n一定承载着所有获胜需要的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbdf67ec85eddeea7da4f41a3f8be6e05953b43f8d1e6b857c6c6ffb8589b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa98ca719987d8f6add77bfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上决胜服，\r\n心态就会跟着转换，\r\n觉得「唔喔喔喔～要跑啰～」呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39bd3099a59a332de77ccee41b3e530e1b736380a53a8237f6c4aba57751b2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5df5dd4ac1f6215bafc844f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，先去跑一趟吧！\r\n早上跑步会让人觉得一天要开始了，\r\n非常畅快呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea932ccbbbce8c5c7c0a33a27d9d029dde34ea62a66cf96c65fccc8dc0e92e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab3e8a3ba25c97bfd62bf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午最好是能好好吃一顿饭！\r\n不过……如果当天很忙，\r\n就会不小心只吃能量棒……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc072556642b18d666da1a2f2e855065f4e0a7fc34e6d3ef250dc9b020aa2534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92906f8893f6b4996ccf2400",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上必须好好休息！\r\n因为明天也要请你从早上\r\n就开始陪我一起练跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca6c416d5f25d50f644d933d628a30ff4f34f7049cc33954d53ac951346adc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2e66bf1e6e06356d902e29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要大跑特跑！在特雷森学园\r\n刮起春天的第一阵强风！\r\n开玩笑的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb01fdc4f4e98c872432f4b8072a239d9454d80ef610951c3b191e63e4e5eaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d703f193f30c102c227905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在摊贩打工很有成就感！\r\n大概是因为离客人很近，\r\n能带给他们许多活力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea928dc8f2c187c8ff152ee637b2fa218b31895a73dd14ad3a5e215c7ae83827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91013"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
